  "output": {
    "svg": "architecture.svg",
    "medium": "documentation and notebook",
    "alt_text": "Explicit application-owned invariants and a labelled seed corpus feed untrusted Hypothesis generators and mutators. Generated values and command sequences exercise a typed action gateway and durable workflow. An observable trace records pre-state, post-state, decisions, and effects. An independent security oracle compares those outcomes with invariants and groups verified failures. A shrinker removes noise only while preserving the same failure, producing a minimal versioned reproducer that enters the regression corpus and informs a release decision. Continuous isolated fuzzing reports coverage, corpus health, flakiness, and triage evidence back to operations."
  },
